{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/building_2.gif?t=1742558926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AstroScaper is a puzzler city-builder with engaging proximity-based placement mechanics. Build your colony at your own pace with minimalist resource management.  Compete in challenge mode with a friend or on leaderboards, or relax in the freebuild mode.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/camera.gif?t=1742558926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calm, relaxing building placement at your on pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated cosmic environments waiting to be filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freebuild mode with no scoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly challenge mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom challenge mode with shareable map seeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing, stylized cosmic scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Photo mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> If you're looking for combat, heavy micromanagement, 4X strategy, or multiplayer, AstroScaper won't satisfy you.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/solars_v2.gif?t=1742558926\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579350?t=1742558926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/97bae9c5387d400fdbccf9362884f7c7d7f233ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742558926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_